  "contracts": {
    "order": "Owned Race: family commit/history/reaction → one primordial-identity spin/reaction → exactly selected six-point recipe → saved caller. Champion: actual selected Archetype reaction → same identity wheel in patron context → exactly selected three-point recipe → Backstory.",
    "grantAuthority": "Execute reward profiles once; wheel links, caption, lore context and mirrored references never dispatch another recipe.",
    "source": "Every fixed grant and stat modifier carries the original race/Archetype invocation and recipe/ordinal, atomically persisted. Resume reuses committed identity and grants.",
    "mastery": "Powers use one shared ordinary Power Mastery; every weapon uses its ordinary recipient mastery. No automatic max, bonus mastery, guarantee or copied God Authority rank.",
    "bonusTiming": "Register at source; calculate all numeric bonuses only at final phase after mandatory events. Weapon effective mastery still controls compatible final Enchant.",
    "mainAcquisitions": "Keep ordinary later Weapon/Power wheels; early inventory survives main None. No additional universal power spin, followers or God80% None merely from a name.",
    "duplicatePolicy": "Use existing definition/source ownership rules; no unrequested duplicate reroll, free tier upgrade, bonus stat conversion or second mastery draw.",
    "weaponPolicy": "Honor existing hard inventory/acquisition locks including Gladiator; no bypass, bonus replacement or extra weapon created by a power caption.",
    "identityBoundary": "Race identity uses family primordial and its actual token; Champion records patronEntityId only, does not acquire/replace race, commit race history, dispatch full six-point race recipe or reopen gate.",
    "loreBoundary": "Research supplies motifs; tiers, powers, weapons and numeric bonuses are authored game adaptations. Retain the user-confirmed origin definition and current-Indonesian-religion curation.",
    "gate": "All owned Primordial identities skip the initial Archetype gate under the existing strong signature-package principle. Champion remains available only to other body/profile-compatible eligible characters; patron itself is not a strong owned race.",
    "bodySize": "No automatic full lore size, cosmic grant, Raksasa/Machine/Elemental event or extra lineage from the entity name. Primordial body/Size reference profiles remain explicit configuration.",
    "distribution": "One identity spin per actual caller, eleven base weights1. Existing Equalizer/eligibility modifiers act by their contracts; no origin/category/power-count wheel.",
    "return": "Nested race grants restore exact caller, including Hybrid/host/base/undead/Mutant; only outer initial race completion goes to Archetype gate. Champion returns to Backstory.",
    "budget": "Every nominal recipe totals6 or3. Comparison is not combat equivalence or automatic post-lock compensation."
  },
